WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.400
Less noise. A better rhythm for your dash.

00:02.400 --> 00:04.400
Meet your filter. The little helper for your minimums.

00:04.400 --> 00:06.950
Low offers? Declined. Below your settings means automatic decline.

00:06.950 --> 00:08.600
You choose the good ones by default.

00:08.600 --> 00:11.400
Your rules. Your rhythm. Tune your minimums. Learned minimums stay visible, too.

00:11.400 --> 00:14.000
Every offer. In perspective. A skyline of your decisions.

00:14.000 --> 00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Jesus Loves You.
We love each other because He loves us first.
1 John 4:19.
